the Iron Ridge Outpost.\n[Shot 1] An extreme long shot from a static camera position, the camera placed slightly high behind the character, pushing in slowly. Chen Luo stands alone at the outermost edge of the rock cliff, his back to the camera, wrapped in a dark cloak lifted by the wind, his figure lean and upright; his right hand hangs naturally at his side, and the dark purple spatial markings on his palm have already faded from sight. Purple light mist rises from the fissure and forms a constantly surging high wall under the dark red sky behind him; his shadow is thrown long from his back onto the scorched earth by the fissure light.\n[Shot 2] At 00:03.000, the shot cuts to a medium close-up. Chen Luo turns around to face the camera, his facial features clear, his expression tired yet calm, fine dust at the corners of his eyes, the collar of his cloak blown flat against the side of his neck; he glances down at his own right palm, then pulls his cloak collar tight. The camera moves from behind him and over his shoulder to the edge of the rock wall, where Su Fang sits half-seated with his back against the rock wall, fine purple markings floating on one forearm, breathing heavily. (S2) Su Fang lifts his head, his voice hoarse: <d>[Chinese] 你是三阶了。</d> Chen Luo does not answer at once; he crouches down to examine Su Fang's arm, takes a waterskin from the spatial storage at his waist, unscrews it and hands it over. (S1) Chen Luo: <d>[Chinese] 嗯。这里的事已经了了。</d>\n[Shot 3] At 00:06.500, the shot cuts to an extreme long shot, the camera fixed behind and to the side of the two figures with the optical axis held level. Chen Luo supports Su Fang as they walk step by step away from the rift across the scorched earth, their two shadows stretched very long across the cracked ground by the low-angle dark red skylight; in the rift behind them the pulse of the purple light mist visibly slows, and now and then a rock breaks loose and raises a small puff of dust; ahead the outline of the low wall of the Iron Ridge Outpost gradually sharpens, sparse lamplight burning on top of the wall, and far away in the direction of Grey Rampart the city wall presses a blurred dark line against the horizon.\n\noverall_soundscape: From deep in the rift a low, muffled rumble of cracking rock continues, intermittent and irregular; wind on the scorched earth carries sand grains that scrape across the rock walls with a fine friction hiss, and the cloak fabric is slapped by the wind into a continuous series of snaps; the two sets of footsteps grind solidly on the cracked ground, and Su Fang's breathing is heavy with suppressed gasps; far off toward the outpost a metal door panel occasionally shifts and the wind moans through gaps in the wall, with the whole environment open and desolate.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: A sustained contrabass tone spreads slowly, layered with sparse single piano notes at an extremely slow tempo; as the camera moves away from the rift, string layers gradually enter and rise slightly, with the volume kept restrained throughout; it closes into a fading sustained tone that rests on an unresolved pitch, leaving a lingering aftertaste.","宽度":"1344","高度":"768","视频秒数":"10"}}}],"widgets_values_named":{"data":{"md_path":"D:\\\\Comfy\\\\stories\\\\七纹刻印\\\\0040_文生视频.md","fields":[{"name":"ID","type":"STRING"},{"name":"视频提示词","type":"TEXT"},{"name":"宽度","type":"INT"},{"name":"高度","type":"INT"},{"name":"视频秒数","type":"INT"}],"selected":{"id":"文生视频-沉星裂谷告别","values":{"ID":"文生视频-沉星裂谷告别","视频提示词":"integrated_multimodal_description: Chinese-animation CG style, a wasteland sci-fi scene, with a clear image and distinct layers; the setting is the edge of a rock cliff above the Chenxing Rift, with cracked scorched earth underfoot whose surface shows two-tone cracks of dark brown and grey-white; behind him a huge fissure tears sideways across the land, and inside it thick purple light mist churns, pulsing upward from below and tinting the surrounding rock walls cold p